      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bristow lies about 19 miles northwest of Cannelton, the county seat, and is positioned near the Ohio River valley, offering scenic views of the surrounding wetlands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
